message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "Unredact: length-constrained infilling of redacted text with diffusion language models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cavanaugh
    given-names: Tobin
    email: "tobincavanaugh@gmail.com"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-04
license: MIT
keywords:
  - redaction recovery
  - diffusion language models
  - masked infilling
  - document analysis
abstract: >-
  A text-only proof of concept for recovering short redacted spans from visible
  context and approximate monospace box-length constraints. The repository
  includes a Mercury backend, a local LLaDA backend, synthetic evaluation data,
  and reproducible evaluation logs.
